WEBVTT

00:10:28.619 --> 00:10:31.811
of the Near Death Experience
Research Foundation,

00:10:31.835 --> 00:10:33.917
and yes, there is such a thing.

00:10:33.941 --> 00:10:36.537
People were interviewed
about their brushes with death

00:10:36.561 --> 00:10:38.307
in all kinds of circumstances:

00:10:38.331 --> 00:10:40.799
car accidents, labor and delivery,

00:10:40.823 --> 00:10:42.256
suicides.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.637
And many reported the same odd thing:

00:10:45.429 --> 00:10:46.603
love.

00:10:47.127 --> 00:10:49.844
I'm sure I would have ignored it
if it hadn't reminded me

00:10:49.868 --> 00:10:51.384
of something I had experienced,

00:10:51.408 --> 00:10:54.197
something I felt
uncomfortable telling anyone:

00:10:54.763 --> 00:10:57.617
that when I was sure
that I was going to die,

00:10:57.641 --> 00:10:59.437
I didn't feel angry.